   "id": "q4",
   "number": "4",
   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "Find the missing number, if a certain rule is followed either row-wise or column-wise.\n\n![figure](asset:q4-stem-fig)",
   "options": [
    {
     "label": "A",
     "text": "42"
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "43"
    },
    {
     "label": "C",
     "text": "41"
    },
    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "40"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "C",
   "solution": "The rule followed is : 7 × 4 = 28 and 28 – 1 = 27;\n\n5 × 8 = 40 and 40 – 1 = 39\n\nSo, 6 × 7 = 42 and 42 – 1 = 41",
